    <body>
        <div class="about">
            <div>
                <h3 class="about_text">
                    Midas Touch Employment Solutions was founded in 2026 in Johannesburg with one goal: to make finding the right talent—and the right job—simpler, fairer, and more human.
We saw too many job seekers struggling to access real opportunities, and too many employers spending time and money on hiring processes that didn’t deliver the right fit. That’s why we built a brokerage that focuses on clarity, transparency, and meaningful results.
Based in Joburg and serving businesses across Gauteng, we connect motivated candidates with employers who value reliability, professionalism, and long‑term growth. Whether you’re a company looking for dependable staff or a job seeker ready for your next step, our role is to make the process smoother and more effective.
Our mission is simple: to match people and businesses with opportunities that help them thrive. We believe in ethical recruitment, honest communication, and treating every placement with care.
As a new and growing company, we’re proud of the relationships we’re already building and the early successes we’ve achieved. Every client and candidate we work with helps shape the future of Midas Touch Employment Solutions.
                </h3>
            </div>
            <div class="info">
            <img class="logo" src="./Branding/IMG-20261019-WA0000.jpg">
